<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Australian stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange was closed on Monday for the Queen's Birthday holiday.</p>
<p>On Friday, stocks closed easier but off their lows in trade dominated by the placement of A$1.5 billion worth of Foster's Brewing Group Ltd shares.</p>
<p>The All Ordinaries Index closed 3.3 points down at 2,600.9.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
